        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Connected care offerings include devices or software that can digitally connect, communicate and/or analyze data to help transform healthcare and improve patient outcomes, and we are continuing to build out our connected care portfolio offerings, which includes smart bed systems, infusion pumps, patient monitoring and diagnostic technologies, respiratory health devices and advanced equipment for the surgical space.",
